#### meta-core (1 finding: 0 error, 0 warning, 1 info)

- `org/class-location` (info, 1)
  - `meta-core:classes/base.bbclass:1`: class base is in classes/, but every release this layer is checked against (wrynose) searches classes-recipe/ and classes-global/ first; move it to classes-global/ (it is used through INHERIT) and keep the name

#### meta-vendor (2 findings: 0 error, 1 warning, 1 info)

- `override/dead` (warning, 1)
  - `meta-vendor:recipes-core/hello/hello_%.bbappend:9`: override `boradx` in `EXTRA_OECONF:append:boradx` is no machine, distro, class, package or OVERRIDES entry in the workspace, so this never applies; fix the name (`boardx`?) or remove the line

